<h1>Download</h1>

<h2>Source Code</h2>

<p>
The source code is hosted on <a href="https://git.marlam.de/">git.marlam.de</a>.
See the <a href="https://git.marlam.de/gitweb/?p=msmtp.git">web frontend for msmtp</a>.<br>
You need the following packages to build from source (note that the package names may
vary between distributions):
<code>git autoconf automake libtool gettext texinfo pkg-config libgnutls-dev</code>.<br>
And this is how it's done:<br>
<code>$ git clone https://git.marlam.de/git/msmtp.git</code><br>
<code>$ cd msmtp</code><br>
<code>$ autoreconf -fi</code><br>
<code>$ ./configure; make; make install</code><br>
</p>

A mirror of the main git repository is available at <a href="https://github.com/marlam/msmtp">github.com/marlam/msmtp</a>.

